== Trivia ==
* "Matt" refers to Matt Kap, a pixel artist for ''The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth'', who has once been afflicted with a kidney stone.
** A kidney stone is a hard deposit made of minerals and salts that form inside kidneys. It will usually pass through the urethra, which is often a very painful process.
* When Isaac enters a room with half a heart and holding this item, he will leave a small puddle of blood rather than pee.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|If Kidney Stone activates while a charged tear effect such as {{i|Tech X}} or {{i|Chocolate Milk}} is currently charging, the charge will get stuck, unable to fire for a somewhat-short period of time, before eventually having the Kidney stone be released as normal. Tears will then occasionally charge, even if a fire button isn't held down anymore.}}
{{bug|{{dlc|r}} With {{i|Monstro's Lung}} and {{i|Technology}}, the stone can be launched but the barrage will not charge Monstro's Lung enough to fire, preventing Isaac from firing at all during the barrage.}}

